WEBVTT

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.299
you must pull out the weeds,
you nurture your plants,

00:11:00.323 --> 00:11:02.315
you take care of certain things,

00:11:02.339 --> 00:11:04.180
you make sure things are watered.

00:11:04.204 --> 00:11:06.149
And at this point,

00:11:06.173 --> 00:11:08.871
because of the way we are organized,
and the way we think

00:11:08.895 --> 00:11:10.991
and the way our information
is brought to us,

00:11:11.015 --> 00:11:12.450
we don't think as a garden,

00:11:12.474 --> 00:11:13.855
we don't think holistically,

00:11:13.879 --> 00:11:18.379
we don't think of the relationships
that are in our lives,

00:11:18.403 --> 00:11:20.212
that are affecting our lives.

00:11:20.236 --> 00:11:21.791
And as a result, we're careless,

00:11:21.815 --> 00:11:24.704
we're polluting the environment,
we're messing it up.

00:11:24.728 --> 00:11:26.402
I mean, on steroids,

00:11:26.426 --> 00:11:30.299
I mean, the world is really in trouble
at this particular point.